data scientist in the world.

00:24:30.970 --> 00:24:35.500
So the total project is broken
up into three main areas.

00:24:35.500 --> 00:24:39.100
We have the computing and
the processing side, the data

00:24:39.100 --> 00:24:42.550
and how it's stored, and
then the front end and output

00:24:42.550 --> 00:24:43.820
side of things.

00:24:43.820 --> 00:24:46.840
So we used Compute Engine
on the Google Cloud

00:24:46.840 --> 00:24:51.700
to host various virtual machines
running Python on Datalab,

00:24:51.700 --> 00:24:54.934
where we could then build
our rules-based algorithms.

00:24:54.934 --> 00:24:57.100
From there, once we were
happy with that, we feature

00:24:57.100 --> 00:24:59.980
engineered from about
15 or 18, I think,

00:24:59.980 --> 00:25:03.400
