into a voting classifier,

00:25:09.824 --> 00:25:12.490
because we were really trying to
squeeze as much out of the data

00:25:12.490 --> 00:25:14.410
as we could.

00:25:14.410 --> 00:25:16.510
The voting classifier
picks the best model

00:25:16.510 --> 00:25:19.780
