so you're getting the best

00:25:19.780 --> 00:25:22.870
prediction every single time.

00:25:22.870 --> 00:25:25.480
We uploaded the data
onto cloud storage

00:25:25.480 --> 00:25:28.210
and then imported
that into BigQuery

00:25:28.210 --> 00:25:30.820
so we could run our SQL
and different Python

00:25:30.820 --> 00:25:33.650
algorithms on that.

00:25:33.650 --> 00:25:37.090
In real time, the data will come
out from the bank's mainframe

00:25:37.090 --> 00:25:38.410
into the cloud.

00:25:38.410 --> 00:25:41.830
So we could run pulse checks
on the different frequency

00:25:41.830 --> 00:25:46.030
